    "title": "自己动手丰衣足食——用Hammerspoon控制Emacs的窗口",
    "uri": "/normal/%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%8A%A8%E6%89%8B%E4%B8%B0%E8%A1%A3%E8%B6%B3%E9%A3%9F%E7%94%A8hammerspoon%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6emacs%E7%9A%84%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3/index.html"
