    "title": "重复输入相似的命令的几种方法",
    "uri": "/normal/%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E7%9B%B8%E4%BC%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%87%A0%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/index.html"
